The Board:
WFP/EB.A/2025/6-A/1 2
i) approves the 2024 annual financial statements of WFP, taking note of the report of the External Auditor, submitted to the Board pursuant to Article XIV.6 (b) of the General Regulations;
ii) notes the funding from the General Fund of USD 1,598,965 during 2024 for the ex-gratia payments and the write off of cash losses and receivables;
iii) notes losses of commodities and other losses during 2024 forming part of operating expenses for the same period.
* This is a draft decision. For the final decision adopted by the Board, please refer to the decisions and recommendations document issued at the end of the session.
